# PENTING: folder `server/api` TIDAK boleh di-exclude.
# Dockerfile.backend (API INTRANET port 3000) memakai
#   COPY server/api/ ./api/
# Kalau foldernya di-exclude, build image API intranet GAGAL dengan
# "COPY failed: file not found in build context".
# Yang dikecualikan hanya file secret lokal (dikirim lewat env_file saat runtime).
server/api/.env.local
server/api/.env.secrets
.tmp-backup
resources
data
*.apk
*.log
session-*.md
